OL,3,GNEWSAMurder-accused denies fatal
OL,4,Astabbing - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of fatally stabbing an
OL,7,Funwanted guest outside his on-off
OL,8,Fgirlfriend's home told police he
OL,9,Fslipped while holding the knife due to
OL,10,Frunning in socks, a court heard.
OL,12,FJohn Robinson in on trial at Bradford
OL,13,FCrown Court accused of killing Mason
OL,14,FJones, following a confrontation in
OL,15,FBurley in Wharefdale in March.
OL,17,FProsecutor David Outterside said the
OL,18,F30-year-old had deliberately stabbed
OL,19,FJones, who was said to be unarmed, in
OL,20,Fthe abdomen with a personalised
OL,21,FJapanese chef's knife he brought to his
OL,22,Fex's home.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
